{"idx": 15, "question_id": "6a62ca0999bf346827f052e9", "bucket": "application_table", "sha256": "2b8610495585dd55a12dde8bd7905c4ac1822561c9b368863c36440cc4c17505", "blind_kind": "MISSING", "deepseek_answer": "题目中“21 21/22”是带分数，但没有配图说明，不过这个信息已足够解题。", "deepseek_answer_type": "", "deepseek_unit": "", "deepseek_raw": "MISSING: 题目中“21 21/22”是带分数，但没有配图说明，不过这个信息已足够解题。  \n我们计算：设自然数为 x，则 x - 1/x = 21 + 21/22 = (21×22+21)/22 = (462+21)/22 = 483/22。  \nx - 1/x = 483/22 → (x² - 1)/x = 483/22 → 22(x² - 1) = 483x → 22x² - 483x - 22 = 0。  \n判别式 Δ = 483² + 4×22×22 = 233289 + 1936 = 235225，√Δ = 485。  \nx = (483 + 485)/(44) = 968/44 = 22，或负数解舍去。  \n所以自然数为22。\n\nANSWER: 22 | TYPE: integer | UNIT:", "a_human_answer": {"value": "22", "answer_type": "integer", "unit": ""}, "a_visual_dependency_prelim": "none", "answer_matches_a": null}
